<%= @order.event.title.upcase %>
<%= '=' * @order.event.title.size %>

Thank you for your reservation.
<% unless @order.amount_owed.zero? %>

<%
  str = <<~TEXT.squish()
    Closer to the event, we will contact you on this e-mail address to finalise the booking by
    paying #{apphelp_money(@order.amount_owed, currency: @order.event.currency)}. No payment
    is needed until then.
  TEXT
%><%= word_wrap(str, line_width: 78) %>
<% end %>

<%= render partial: 'order', object: @order %>
<%= ordershelp_magic_link_markup(@order, plain_text: true) %>
If there are any problems with the reservation, please get in touch:

<%= render partial: 'contact' %>
<%= render partial: 'signature' %>
